      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i keep getting a \"run-time error '1004': application-defined or object-defined error\" when i try to run this macro for my monthly reconciliation. it usually works fine but today it just stops. can u help me figure out what's wrong?\n\nSub MonthlyRecon()\n    Dim ws As Worksheet\n    Set ws = ThisWorkbook.Sheets(\"Reconciliation_Report\")\n    \n    ws.Range(\"A1:Z100\").ClearContents\n    \n    Dim lastRow As Long\n    lastRow = ws.Cells(ws.Rows.Count, \"A\").End(xlUp).Row\n    \n    ws.Range(\"A2:Z\" & lastRow).Value = Sheets(\"Data_Dump\").Range(\"A2:Z\" & lastRow).Value\n    \n    MsgBox \"Report generated successfully\"\nEnd Sub",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
